 [1m--features[22m complete|attributes-only                         Output features                                            
 [1m--[no-]just-types[22m                                           Plain types only (off by default)                          
 [1m--base-class[22m EntityData|Object                              Base class                                                 
 [1m--[no-]check-required[22m                                       Fail if required properties are missing (off by default)   
