[1mExamples[22m

  [2mGenerate C# to parse a Bitcoin API[22m                                            
  $ quicktype -o LatestBlock.cs https://blockchain.info/latestblock             
                                                                                
  [2mGenerate Go code from a directory of samples containing:[22m                      
  [2m  - Foo.json[22m                                                                  
  [2m  + Bar[22m                                                                       
  [2m    - bar-sample-1.json[22m                                                       
  [2m    - bar-sample-2.json[22m                                                       
  [2m  - Baz.url[22m                                                                   
  $ quicktype -l go samples                                                     
                                                                                
  [2mGenerate JSON Schema, then TypeScript[22m                                         
  $ quicktype -o schema.json https://blockchain.info/latestblock                
  $ quicktype -o bitcoin.ts --src-lang schema schema.json                       

  Learn more at [1mquicktype.io[22m 

